                Kaliteli Ürünler
            </h5>

        </div>
    </div>


    <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 pb-1">
        <div class="d-flex align-items-center border mb-4"
             style="padding: 30px;">

            <h1 class="fa fa-shipping-fast text-primary m-0 mr-3"></h1>

            <h5 class="font-weight-semi-bold m-0">
                Ücretsiz Kargo
            </h5>

        </div>
    </div>


    <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 pb-1">
        <div class="d-flex align-items-center border mb-4"
             style="padding: 30px;">

            <h1 class="fas fa-exchange-alt text-primary m-0 mr-3"></h1>

            <h5 class="font-weight-semi-bold m-0">
                14 Gün Değişim Süreci
            </h5>

        </div>
    </div>


    <div class="col-lg-3 col-md-6 pb-1">
        <div class="d-flex align-items-center border mb-4"
